# Build this worker from its Rust project. Its two stages share one binary:
# start exact-request-tail-calls `subreq`; finish appends task status to the
# target conversation ref and passes the result through. It selects git-runner
# because the finish stage updates that ref with ordinary Git.
run --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/rustc --src:@=. --output-runner:@=DEEP-DEPS/git-runner
